sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant B as Browser (React)
    participant CORS as CORS Middleware
    participant JWT as JWT Auth Middleware
    participant R as v1 Router
    participant H as Route Handler
    participant S as Service Layer
    participant DB as SQLite / KV

    B->>CORS: GET /v1/portfolio/nav (Bearer JWT)
    CORS->>JWT: pass-through
    JWT->>JWT: verify signature + expiry
    alt valid
        JWT->>R: forward request
        R->>H: dispatch portfolio.nav
        H->>S: PortfolioService.get_nav()
        S->>DB: SELECT FROM portfolio_snapshots
        DB-->>S: row
        S-->>H: NAVResponse(pydantic)
        H-->>R: 200 JSON
        R-->>B: response
    else invalid
        JWT-->>B: 401 Unauthorized
    end
